WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.317 --> 00:00:15.917
Maggie called.

2
00:00:16.618 --> 00:00:19.460
"Stop!" Nora looked over at them.

3
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:20.981
Then she ran away.

4
00:00:21.001 --> 00:00:24.203
"Hey," Henry exclaimed in surprise.

5
00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:25.784
"Catch her!"

6
00:00:26.045 --> 00:00:27.486
Cole took off after Nora.

7
00:00:28.406 --> 00:00:30.708
Henry followed, with Maggie right beside him.

8
00:00:31.744 --> 00:00:33.986
Nora was surprisingly fast for a little kid.

9
00:00:34.687 --> 00:00:36.428
She turned into a booth filled with pottery.

10
00:00:36.448 --> 00:00:43.074
"Careful," Maggie exclaimed as The Lemonade Detectives ran into the booth behind her.

11
00:00:43.094 --> 00:00:45.356
"This stuff looks breakable."

12
00:00:46.117 --> 00:00:50.040
Just ahead Nora scooted under a low table full of vases.

13
00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:53.143
"We can't fit under there," cried Henry.

14
00:00:53.163 --> 00:00:55.065
"We'll have to go around!"

15
00:00:56.186 --> 00:00:58.108
Cole had already dashed out of the booth.

16
00:00:59.164 --> 00:01:02.125
Henry and Maggie followed as Cole sprinted after Nora.

17
00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:04.365
"Nora, stop!"

18
00:01:04.606 --> 00:01:05.246
Maggie yelled.

19
00:01:05.266 --> 00:01:07.326
"We just want to talk to you!"

20
00:01:07.346 --> 00:01:08.987
"There she goes."

21
00:01:09.307 --> 00:01:10.007
Cole pointed.

22
00:01:10.727 --> 00:01:12.548
Nora was ducking into another booth.

23
00:01:13.888 --> 00:01:14.968
Maggie ran after her.

24
00:01:15.628 --> 00:01:16.929
Henry and Cole followed.

25
00:01:17.729 --> 00:01:19.449
They found themselves in a quilting booth.

26
00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.090
"Hey, what are you kids doing?"

27
00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:23.270
a woman exclaimed.

28
00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:25.451
"This isn't a playground!"

29
00:01:25.471 --> 00:01:28.592
"Sorry," Henry said breathlessly.

30
00:01:29.312 --> 00:01:31.173
Then he ran out of the booth after Nora.

31
00:01:32.114 --> 00:01:35.456
She was heading out of the crafts fair and across the central part of the park.

32
00:01:36.537 --> 00:01:39.579
She ducked between two people waiting in line to buy hot dogs.

33
00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:43.782
"Excuse me," Henry said, trying to push after her.

34
00:01:43.802 --> 00:01:46.484
"Hey! Get in the back of the line!"

35
00:01:46.724 --> 00:01:47.845
one of the customers said.

36
00:01:47.865 --> 00:01:50.827
"We're just passing through," Maggie said.

37
00:01:51.868 --> 00:01:52.928
Then she pointed at Nora.

38
00:01:52.948 --> 00:01:55.170
"We need to catch that little girl!"

39
00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:57.932
"Oh, why didn't you say so?"

40
00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:00.721
the customer grumbled, finally moving aside.

41
00:02:01.601 --> 00:02:03.681
For a second Henry thought they'd lost Nora.

42
00:02:04.602 --> 00:02:06.602
Then he spotted her running into the art show.

43
00:02:07.362 --> 00:02:09.183
She ducked behind the nearest display.

44
00:02:09.203 --> 00:02:13.284
"Hurry!" Henry called to his friends, running after Nora.

45
00:02:13.304 --> 00:02:15.625
"We have to—oof!"

46
00:02:16.725 --> 00:02:18.025
He crashed into someone.

47
00:02:18.045 --> 00:02:20.886
"Hey," a familiar voice said.

48
00:02:20.906 --> 00:02:22.687
"Watch where you're going!"

49
00:02:23.727 --> 00:02:24.387
It was Hannah!

50
00:02:24.407 --> 00:02:26.328
"What are you doing here?"

51
00:02:26.648 --> 00:02:27.828
Maggie sounded surprised.

52
00:02:28.768 --> 00:02:31.389
"I decided to go for a walk," Hannah replied.

53
00:02:31.409 --> 00:02:33.289
"It's a free country."

54
00:02:33.309 --> 00:02:35.850
"Okay," Henry said.

55
00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:38.691
"We're just surprised to see you here."

56
00:02:38.711 --> 00:02:43.132
"Yeah. We thought you didn't like the art show," Cole added.

57
00:02:44.033 --> 00:02:44.753
Hannah shrugged.

58
00:02:44.773 --> 00:02:47.634
"Does that mean I'm not allowed to walk past it?"

59
00:02:47.654 --> 00:02:49.754
"No," Henry said.

60
00:02:49.774 --> 00:02:52.875
"But it makes you look a little suspicious."

61
00:02:54.276 --> 00:02:54.996
Maggie nodded.

62
00:02:55.752 --> 00:02:59.375
"I bet she's trying to sabotage the whole art show by stealing the best painting!"

63
00:02:59.395 --> 00:03:02.058
"What?" Hannah exclaimed.

64
00:03:02.078 --> 00:03:04.400
"No way, I wouldn't do that!"

65
00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:06.501
"Are you sure?"

66
00:03:06.742 --> 00:03:07.302
Cole said.

67
00:03:07.322 --> 00:03:11.606
"You acted pretty weird when we mentioned Nathan's painting earlier.

68
00:03:12.506 --> 00:03:14.909
And a few minutes later, it disappeared!"

69
00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:17.070
"I didn't take it."

70
00:03:17.291 --> 00:03:18.872
Hannah didn't sound annoyed anymore.

71
00:03:18.892 --> 00:03:20.914
"I'd never do that.

72
00:03:21.915 --> 00:03:23.336
Nathan's really talented.

73
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.401
He deserves to win that spot in the museum!"

74
00:03:27.421 --> 00:03:28.561
She sounded sincere.

75
00:03:28.581 --> 00:03:31.342
"Why would you care about his painting?"

76
00:03:31.622 --> 00:03:32.322
Henry asked.

77
00:03:32.342 --> 00:03:34.823
"I thought you didn't like art."

78
00:03:34.843 --> 00:03:37.764
"That's not true," Hannah said quickly.

79
00:03:37.784 --> 00:03:39.784
"Actually, I love art."

80
00:03:39.804 --> 00:03:42.605
"Huh?" Maggie looked confused.

81
00:03:42.625 --> 00:03:46.146
"But you said—" "I know," Hannah interrupted.

82
00:03:46.166 --> 00:03:49.627
"I was just mad because I couldn't enter the art show myself."

83
00:03:50.847 --> 00:03:52.028
"You were going to enter?"

84
00:03:52.288 --> 00:03:52.988
Cole asked.

85
00:03:53.952 --> 00:03:54.652
Hannah nodded.

86
00:03:54.672 --> 00:03:56.993
"I like basket weaving.

87
00:03:57.934 --> 00:04:00.675
But I'm not crazy about it like my parents are.

88
00:04:01.515 --> 00:04:02.395
I'm a sculptor."

89
00:04:02.415 --> 00:04:04.916
"Really?" Henry said.

90
00:04:04.936 --> 00:04:08.018
"Yes. Want to see my latest sculpture?"

91
00:04:08.238 --> 00:04:09.298
Hannah asked shyly.

92
00:04:09.318 --> 00:04:12.099
"I have pictures of it on my phone."

93
00:04:12.119 --> 00:04:14.300
"Sure," Henry said.

94
00:04:15.261 --> 00:04:19.062
Hannah pulled out her phone and showed Henry and the others photos of her sculpture.

95
00:04:20.043 --> 00:04:21.603
It was of a girl holding a cat.

96
00:04:21.623 --> 00:04:24.376
"Wow," Cole said.

97
00:04:24.396 --> 00:04:26.097
"You're really good!"

98
00:04:26.117 --> 00:04:29.058
"Thanks." Hannah sounded sad.

99
00:04:29.078 --> 00:04:31.858
"I wanted to enter the art show this year.

100
00:04:32.779 --> 00:04:37.580
But my family was so busy getting ready for the crafts fair, I didn't have much time to

101
00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:41.281
sculpt. So my piece wasn't ready in time."

102
00:04:41.301 --> 00:04:45.442
"That's why you sounded mad earlier," Henry guessed.

103
00:04:46.282 --> 00:04:47.423
"I guess I was jealous."

104
00:04:48.423 --> 00:04:49.103
Hannah sighed.

105
00:04:49.123 --> 00:04:53.876
"But I wouldn't steal another artist's work—I promise."

106
00:04:54.997 --> 00:04:55.897
Henry believed her.

107
00:04:56.598 --> 00:04:58.098
He could tell his friends did too.

108
00:04:58.118 --> 00:05:02.700
"Thanks for showing us your sculpture," he said, handing back Hannah's phone.

109
00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:04.981
"Sorry we suspected you."

110
00:05:05.001 --> 00:05:07.302
"It's okay," Hannah said.

111
00:05:07.322 --> 00:05:08.883
"I don't blame you.

112
00:05:09.243 --> 00:05:10.344
I was acting weird."

113
00:05:10.364 --> 00:05:13.065
"You sure were," Maggie told her.

114
00:05:13.085 --> 00:05:15.106
"But I understand why now."

115
00:05:16.106 --> 00:05:16.867
Hannah smiled.

116
00:05:16.887 --> 00:05:18.968
"Want to watch the judging with me?"

117
00:05:19.208 --> 00:05:19.728
she asked.

118
00:05:20.748 --> 00:05:23.609
"I figure that will help me get inspired to enter next year."

119
00:05:23.629 --> 00:05:26.550
"Sorry, we can't," Cole said.

120
00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:29.170
"We still have to solve the mystery."

121
00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:31.591
"Yeah," Henry said.

122
00:05:31.611 --> 00:05:34.852
"We need to track down Nora!"

123
00:05:35.052 --> 00:05:35.592
he shouted.

124
00:05:36.472 --> 00:05:38.493
The little girl was tiptoeing past them again.

125
00:05:39.653 --> 00:05:41.554
She heard Henry yell and started running.

126
00:05:42.554 --> 00:05:46.995
Maggie leaped forward and grabbed Nora's arm before the little girl could duck under the next display.

127
00:05:47.015 --> 00:05:48.436
"Got her!"

128
00:05:48.696 --> 00:05:49.536
Maggie exclaimed.

129
00:05:50.632 --> 00:05:51.894
Nora burst into tears.

130
00:05:51.914 --> 00:05:54.237
"I'm sorry!"

131
00:05:54.878 --> 00:05:55.458
she wailed.

132
00:05:55.479 --> 00:05:59.203
"I only took it because of Patches!"
